Output docs/media/push.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1640
Set Height 820
Set Padding 14
Set Margin 22
Set MarginFill "#11111b"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 36
Set BorderRadius 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Framerate 24
Env COLORTERM truecolor
Env GITPAD_LOGO text
Hide
Type 'cd "$GITPAD_DEMO" && clear && gitpad' Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 800ms
Type "P"
Sleep 1.5s
Screenshot docs/screenshots/push.png
Type "t"
Sleep 700ms
Type "t"
Sleep 700ms
Escape
Sleep 800ms
